%% DERIVED narrative — DO NOT redefine message shapes. See derived_from[] for constituent files.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device
    participant RealtimeService
    participant SafetyService
    participant ContentService
    participant GoogleLiveFlash

    Note over Device,GoogleLiveFlash: Composition view — single child voice turn across 5 systems.
    Device->>RealtimeService: audio.chunk frames (sys-03 realtime-turn and sys-18 wire-protocol)
    RealtimeService->>SafetyService: input filter (sys-05 input-filter)
    alt input_filter_block
        SafetyService-->>RealtimeService: blocked, reason
        RealtimeService-->>Device: audio.response — safe fallback (sys-05 fallback-selection)
    else allowed
        RealtimeService->>ContentService: retrieve relevant pack (sys-06 retrieval)
        ContentService-->>RealtimeService: pack snippets — or miss
        Note over ContentService,RealtimeService: content_retrieval_miss_fallback — RealtimeService proceeds without RAG
        RealtimeService->>GoogleLiveFlash: llm.generate (sys-04 turn-pipeline)
        alt provider_failover_triggered
            GoogleLiveFlash--xRealtimeService: timeout — see sys-04 provider-failover
            RealtimeService->>GoogleLiveFlash: failover to secondary region
        end
        GoogleLiveFlash-->>RealtimeService: response tokens
        RealtimeService->>SafetyService: output filter (sys-05 output-filter)
        alt output_filter_block
            SafetyService-->>RealtimeService: blocked
            RealtimeService-->>Device: audio.response — safe fallback
        else allowed
            RealtimeService-->>Device: audio.response frames
        end
        Note over Device,RealtimeService: barge_in_mid_turn — see sys-04 barge-in
    end
